WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:15.145
Yes! The store was full of beautiful things.

2
00:00:15.146 --> 00:00:16.840
Clerk: Can I help you?

3
00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:20.874
Mom: Yes, please. I am looking for a tablecloth.

4
00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:23.266
Clerk: This way, please.

5
00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:25.989
All the tablecloths are in that corner.

6
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.879
Clerk: Let me know if you need help.

7
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:32.383
Mom: I see. Thank you.

8
00:00:32.384 --> 00:00:36.053
Excuse me. Do you have this in gold?

9
00:00:36.054 --> 00:00:38.948
Clerk: Oh, yes. Here you go.

10
00:00:38.949 --> 00:00:41.410
Mom: That's perfect. Thank you.

11
00:00:41.411 --> 00:00:45.806
Clerk: You're welcome.

12
00:00:45.807 --> 00:00:48.658
Mom: I would like to buy these two, please.

13
00:00:48.659 --> 00:00:51.462
Clerk: Sure. Cash or credit card?

14
00:00:51.463 --> 00:00:55.472
Mom: Credit card, please.

15
00:00:55.473 --> 00:00:57.368
Clerk: One moment, please.

16
00:00:57.369 --> 00:00:59.328
Sign right here, please.

17
00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:01.286
Mom: Okay. There.

18
00:01:01.287 --> 00:01:04.978
Clerk: Thank you. Here is your card and the receipt.

19
00:01:04.979 --> 00:01:08.390
Mom: Thanks.

20
00:01:08.391 --> 00:01:11.465
What a wonderful tablecloth!

21
00:01:11.466 --> 00:01:20.486
It has gold lace all around it.
